  "subject": "a ten-year-old girl in Tai Po trying to collect forty supermarket stamps for a tiny ceramic kitchen-set figure before the promotion ends on Sunday, drafting every adult she knows into buying milk",
  "caption": "Cantonese chiptune pop in the 8-bit console style. Bright square-wave lead synth melody; bouncing triangle-wave bass; crunchy noise-channel drums; fast arpeggiated pulse-wave chords. Crisp lo-bit game-console sound, dry mix, short echoes. Female mid-high voice, quick bright playful delivery. 150 BPM, E major. Bright, bouncy and funny. No trap beats, no autotune, no dubstep wobble, no orchestral swells, no rock guitar.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n超市換購細陶瓷\n迷你砂煲同砧板\n要儲四十個印花\n我得十七個啫\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n禮拜日就截止\n我要諗吓辦法\n\n[Chorus]\n印花印花 畀我啦\n買牛奶記得叫我\n一個兩個 貼落簿\n差廿三個咋\n\n[Verse]\n表哥買咗兩箱水\n姨姨買咗啲廁紙\n樓下陳伯唔要印花\n全部塞入我手\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n學校同學都幫手\n有人帶埋成卷嚟\n\n[Chorus]\n印花印花 畀我啦\n買麵包記得叫我\n一個兩個 貼落簿\n差九個咋\n\n[Verse]\n禮拜六晚數一數\n原來仲差一個\n我去買粒波板糖\n收銀姐姐眨眨眼\n\n[Bridge]\n佢畀咗我兩個\n話一個係送嘅\n\n[Chorus]\n印花印花 夠喇啦\n換咗個細砧板\n一個兩個 擺上架\n仲淨返一個\n\n[Chorus]\n印花印花 夠喇啦\n換咗個細砧板\n一個兩個 擺上架\n仲淨返一個\n\n[Outro]\n下期換購係乜\n我已經開始儲",
